WEBVTT

01:31.931 --> 01:36.936
[Flourished Peony]

01:36.936 --> 01:39.624
[Episode 25]

01:48.439 --> 01:50.799
I've been very busy. I'm too tired

01:51.319 --> 01:52.480
to prepare something to eat.

01:53.040 --> 01:54.480
I hope you won't mind.

02:00.079 --> 02:03.319
How did you know I came, not Zhu Fu?

02:04.040 --> 02:06.319
Zhu Fu doesn't have

02:06.879 --> 02:08.719
the fragrance of incense.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.520
You're very busy.

02:23.159 --> 02:25.439
Yet you have time to deal with people
from the black market.

02:26.719 --> 02:28.120
How bold you are.

02:31.759 --> 02:34.960
Mr. Jiang, on the day we left the barracks,

02:35.639 --> 02:37.080
you said you already considered me a friend.

02:37.759 --> 02:40.599
If so, feel free to speak frankly.

02:42.879 --> 02:44.400
I know that since you arrived in Chang'an,

02:45.639 --> 02:47.400
you have been dwelling on revenge
for your mother and Yulu,

02:48.319 --> 02:50.360
seeking an opportunity to punish Liu Shen.

02:52.080 --> 02:54.520
But if you're against the powerful
as a merchant,

02:55.159 --> 02:56.719
it'll be very dangerous.

02:58.039 --> 02:59.840
If Liu Shen discovers
that you are investigating him,

03:00.400 --> 03:01.960
he might secretly have men abduct you

03:01.960 --> 03:03.080
and throw you into the river.

03:03.759 --> 03:05.159
Even I might not be able to find you.

03:08.840 --> 03:10.240
How did you know?

03:10.240 --> 03:11.759
Chuanyu saw the man

03:11.759 --> 03:13.599
you hired to follow Liu Shen
in the black market.

03:15.919 --> 03:17.479
I want to expose Liu Shen

03:17.479 --> 03:19.479
indeed for my mother and Yulu.

03:20.479 --> 03:22.080
But it's not just for my vengeance.

03:23.199 --> 03:25.960
Liu Shen harms the people for money.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.840
Though I'm as weak as an ant,

03:29.560 --> 03:31.000
I'm not dead meat.

03:31.520 --> 03:33.199
Countless ants can give it a try.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.520
But you are alone.

03:36.879 --> 03:38.560
I'm not advising you
to stand by and do nothing.

03:39.199 --> 03:41.240
I hope that you will play it safe.

03:43.479 --> 03:45.000
I know you're worried.

03:45.879 --> 03:47.120
I understand your concerns.

03:47.759 --> 03:50.560
Rest assured, I will be cautious.

03:51.120 --> 03:54.080
I will make my move at the right time.

04:13.039 --> 04:14.759
All the grain shops in the West Market

04:15.560 --> 04:17.199
are in cahoots with Liu Shen,

04:18.160 --> 04:20.399
mixing in old millet
that should have been destroyed.

04:21.360 --> 04:24.079
This is not something that he can do alone.

04:24.079 --> 04:25.759
Behind Liu Shen lies a tangled web.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.199
If he collapses,

04:28.759 --> 04:31.199
the people behind him will fall too.

04:32.720 --> 04:36.560
What you are facing
is never just one corrupt official.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.480
You are also investigating the millet case?

04:43.600 --> 04:45.439
You don't just want to take down Liu Shen,

04:46.079 --> 04:48.639
but also to strike hard at the power brokers
behind him, right?

04:51.000 --> 04:53.639
If this is as dangerous as you say it is,

04:53.639 --> 04:55.240
I can no longer stand by.

04:57.680 --> 04:59.839
Since we both want the evil men
to be brought to justice,

05:00.639 --> 05:01.879
how about we work together?

05:03.879 --> 05:05.600
You're overconfident.

05:06.759 --> 05:08.759
Can you interfere in political affairs?

05:09.519 --> 05:11.639
No, I can't interfere.

05:12.399 --> 05:14.680
But when it comes to punishing Liu Shen,

05:14.680 --> 05:18.040
we need concerted efforts
to ensure a sure victory.

05:20.399 --> 05:21.920
In this nation,

05:21.920 --> 05:24.439
the common people outnumber officials, right?

05:26.240 --> 05:28.680
You stir things up in the official circles

05:28.680 --> 05:30.160
and show your mettle.

05:30.160 --> 05:33.680
But as a commoner, I can also do something.

05:35.879 --> 05:39.519
There is strength in numbers.

05:41.279 --> 05:42.480
So, you mean,

05:43.319 --> 05:46.279
the grievances of the common people
are a sharper knife?

05:47.399 --> 05:49.639
It's not something
a few high officials can defeat.

05:51.120 --> 05:54.120
Since they deceive their superiors
and oppress the people,

05:55.639 --> 05:57.439
they shouldn't blame us

05:58.560 --> 05:59.688
for faking.

06:22.779 --> 06:25.352
[Jiang Mansion]

06:46.959 --> 06:48.136
Mr. Ren.

06:51.112 --> 06:52.160
Is it tasty?

06:52.680 --> 06:53.864
Sure.

07:06.240 --> 07:09.360
I truly didn't know before

07:09.360 --> 07:11.600
that Lady He was on your side.

07:11.600 --> 07:13.879
I mistakenly believed the words
of the troublemakers.

07:13.879 --> 07:15.639
So I gave her severe penalties.

07:15.639 --> 07:18.360
Please forgive me, Mr. Jiang.

07:19.079 --> 07:20.360
It's alright. After all, you didn't know.

07:21.279 --> 07:22.600
Don't worry.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.680
If I bear a grudge,

07:24.680 --> 07:27.360
I won't invite you to watch the flower.

07:28.720 --> 07:30.920
Your tolerance

07:30.920 --> 07:34.279
makes me feel even more ashamed.

07:36.759 --> 07:39.079
I rarely see the beauty.

07:39.079 --> 07:40.759
Thanks to you,

07:40.759 --> 07:42.088
I have the honor of seeing it.

07:42.088 --> 07:44.199
It is a great honor.

07:44.199 --> 07:45.519
Here's to you.

07:47.000 --> 07:50.360
The best part of this flower is
that it blooms at night

07:50.360 --> 07:52.000
only for a fleeting moment.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.920
It's a beautiful sight.

07:53.920 --> 07:56.800
It'll be dull if I don't watch it with others.

08:06.839 --> 08:08.879
Excuse me for a moment.

08:08.879 --> 08:10.240
Everyone, make yourself at home.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.920
Enjoy yourselves.

08:29.439 --> 08:32.360
Although they ate moldy rice,

08:32.360 --> 08:34.679
it started a bit too quickly.

08:35.759 --> 08:37.639
They've been eating delicate food.

08:38.639 --> 08:40.440
Their stomachs can't withstand this.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.000
Mr. Ren, are you okay?

08:57.000 --> 08:59.039
I've been waiting for the flower to blossom.

08:59.039 --> 09:00.759
That's why I'm holding this banquet.

09:01.840 --> 09:04.279
Yet now, I've missed the blooming scenery.

09:06.159 --> 09:07.960
Bring the kitchen staff to me.

09:07.960 --> 09:11.240
Make sure to find out what went wrong.

09:11.759 --> 09:12.872
Yes.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.799
My lord, I've found out.

09:23.799 --> 09:27.000
The soup at the banquet
was made with inferior millet.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.480
That's why it made everyone feel unwell.

09:29.279 --> 09:31.440
This matter is probably not simple.

09:33.320 --> 09:35.279
Could it be
that someone is attempting to poison me?

09:36.799 --> 09:40.480
Tell me. Who instructed you to do this?

09:41.799 --> 09:44.759
My mother is ill.

09:44.759 --> 09:46.000
I need money for her treatment.

09:46.960 --> 09:49.279
To save money, I didn't buy millet
in the East Market,

09:49.279 --> 09:51.279
but in the West Market.

09:51.279 --> 09:53.879
I didn't know that the millet
from the West Market was inferior.

09:53.879 --> 09:55.960
My lord, considering my filial piety,

09:55.960 --> 09:57.440
please spare me.

09:57.440 --> 09:58.559
Spare me.

10:00.440 --> 10:01.679
Whether someone has tried to poison me,

10:02.320 --> 10:04.559
or if the grain shops
in the West Market are behind it,

10:06.320 --> 10:09.200
Mr. Ren, you investigate this matter

10:09.799 --> 10:14.000
for me and our colleagues here.

10:14.639 --> 10:15.720
That's right.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.799
You must find out.

10:16.799 --> 10:17.832
Yes.

10:19.399 --> 10:20.679
- Again.
- Alright.

10:20.679 --> 10:21.800
Again.

10:22.376 --> 10:23.880
[Grain]

10:25.200 --> 10:27.480
Everyone, look at this millet.

10:28.240 --> 10:30.320
The grain shop is selling inferior goods,

10:30.320 --> 10:32.120
moldy millet.

10:33.879 --> 10:35.559
Look at my face.

10:39.080 --> 10:41.679
My face has been disfigured

10:41.679 --> 10:45.080
by the incense powder made
from this kind of millet.

10:46.759 --> 10:49.120
As the owner of Huamanzhu,

10:49.120 --> 10:52.320
even if I suffer the loss
of money and reputation,

10:52.320 --> 10:54.639
I absolutely can't sell bad incense powder

10:54.639 --> 10:55.759
to the people.

10:55.759 --> 10:56.879
- Right.
- Exactly.

10:56.879 --> 10:58.320
Please rest assured,

10:58.320 --> 11:01.159
I've already sent people
to withdraw the shoddy goods.

11:01.159 --> 11:04.200
However, the main culprit is still at large.

11:04.200 --> 11:06.039
But I must let everyone know

11:06.039 --> 11:07.919
the true nature of this unscrupulous shop.

11:08.799 --> 11:11.559
I bought millet from it.

11:11.559 --> 11:12.679
When cooking,

11:12.679 --> 11:14.639
I have seen black spots on the millet.

11:15.159 --> 11:18.039
I thought it was just dirty
and washing it would be fine.

11:18.039 --> 11:20.279
Could it be that I bought moldy grains?

11:21.440 --> 11:24.159
Exactly, the moldy millet is tiny.

11:24.159 --> 11:26.559
Without close examination, it's not noticeable.

11:26.559 --> 11:30.000
That's why everyone has been kept in the dark.

11:30.000 --> 11:34.039
Consuming moldy millet harms our health.

11:34.039 --> 11:35.639
Yes, indeed.

11:35.639 --> 11:39.039
Medical books state that the stomach
is the foundation of the viscera.

11:39.039 --> 11:41.600
Eating bad grains for a day or two
won't show much effect.

11:41.600 --> 11:42.960
But if consumed for a long time,

11:42.960 --> 11:46.000
I'm afraid it will spoil our health.

11:46.000 --> 11:47.480
It brings endless troubles.

11:49.440 --> 11:52.480
No wonder I've been suffering
from stomach pains.

11:52.480 --> 11:54.200
Turns out it was caused by bad grains.

11:54.200 --> 11:56.080
What an unscrupulous merchant.

11:56.080 --> 11:57.960
Let's go in and demand an explanation.

11:58.799 --> 12:01.000
No, you mustn't do that.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.440
Everyone, please calm down.

12:02.440 --> 12:04.000
We're just ordinary folks.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.759
If we argue with them,

12:05.759 --> 12:08.159
they will get something on us.

12:10.639 --> 12:12.840
The owner of this grain shop
has committed a crime.

12:12.840 --> 12:14.720
He should be arrested by the authorities.

12:14.720 --> 12:16.559
All we need to do
is report him to the officials.

12:16.559 --> 12:19.399
I believe
the Jingzhao Prefecture will do justice.

12:19.960 --> 12:23.080
Can't we make him do refunds today?

12:23.720 --> 12:27.120
If I keep waiting, my illness will get worse.

12:27.120 --> 12:29.720
- Yeah.
- Yes.

12:29.720 --> 12:31.879
Although Huamanzhu is also a victim,

12:32.519 --> 12:34.480
I still feel guilty

12:34.480 --> 12:36.000
about selling inferior goods.

12:36.799 --> 12:39.679
Therefore, I've hired a physician
to see patients.

12:40.480 --> 12:43.080
Those who have bought incense powder in my shop

12:43.080 --> 12:47.000
will get stomach medicine for free.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.799
What about those who haven't bought it?

12:50.519 --> 12:52.519
What should we do?

12:52.519 --> 12:56.080
Even so, you can see the physician for free.

12:56.080 --> 12:58.679
Huamanzhu would like to do good deeds.

12:58.679 --> 13:01.159
I'll sell the medicine at cost price

13:01.159 --> 13:04.159
to those who have stomach problems.

13:05.000 --> 13:06.480
You're so nice.

13:06.480 --> 13:07.960
Thank you.

13:07.960 --> 13:09.559
You're welcome.

13:09.559 --> 13:10.879
It's what I ought to do.

13:11.519 --> 13:13.840
Please get your medicine
over there. Next, please.

13:17.399 --> 13:18.559
You have a stomach ache?

13:18.559 --> 13:20.200
- Here's your medicine.
- Thank you.

13:20.200 --> 13:21.519
The moldy millet harmed my health.

13:23.279 --> 13:25.799
After hearing your words,
they filed complaints in droves.

13:25.799 --> 13:27.200
But the Jingzhao Prefecture
doesn't take up the case.

13:27.799 --> 13:29.720
Now the people are being blocked
outside the government office's gate.

13:32.520 --> 13:33.639
Good.

13:34.639 --> 13:35.639
What do you mean?

13:36.159 --> 13:37.879
I knew officials would cover for each other.

13:38.559 --> 13:42.399
What I want is the flames of the fury
of the common people.

13:43.399 --> 13:44.960
At the right time,

13:44.960 --> 13:46.480
the flames will get huge.

13:48.440 --> 13:50.720
This time, I must

13:50.720 --> 13:52.279
get guilty officials burned

13:53.399 --> 13:54.600
until they collapse.

13:55.600 --> 13:57.679
Great.

14:00.159 --> 14:01.256
Again.

14:09.320 --> 14:12.519
Attention, ladies and gentlemen.

14:13.120 --> 14:16.000
I am He Weifang, the owner of Huamanzhu.

14:16.000 --> 14:19.240
There is a matter
concerning everyone's life and health.

14:19.240 --> 14:21.519
Please listen to me.

14:22.559 --> 14:24.639
I believe you've heard

14:24.639 --> 14:28.120
that a grain shop in the West Market
is selling moldy millet extensively.

14:28.120 --> 14:30.600
I thought it was only one shop's mistake.

14:30.600 --> 14:32.759
To continue my incense powder business,

14:32.759 --> 14:36.080
I turned to other grain shops for purchases.

14:36.080 --> 14:39.679
To my shock, in the entire West Market,

14:39.679 --> 14:43.080
all grain shops are selling moldy millet.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.639
Everyone, please take a look!

14:44.639 --> 14:45.840
This is all moldy millet.

14:47.639 --> 14:49.960
It's a huge thing.

14:49.960 --> 14:52.639
Yet the Jingzhao Prefecture
actually refused to handle it.

14:53.519 --> 14:54.559
The officials eat

14:54.559 --> 14:56.000
good grains from the East Market.

14:56.000 --> 14:58.039
They disregard the lives of us commoners.

14:59.759 --> 15:03.120
Everyone, though each of us alone is weak,

15:03.120 --> 15:04.840
there is strength in numbers.

15:04.840 --> 15:06.440
As long as every household

15:06.440 --> 15:10.120
gathers evidence and appeals to the officials,

15:10.120 --> 15:12.759
we will surely make the officials
investigate the matter

15:12.759 --> 15:14.879
and return a safe West Market to us.

15:15.759 --> 15:18.120
If everyone wants to stay healthy,

15:18.120 --> 15:20.200
we must fight for ourselves.

15:20.200 --> 15:22.600
Today we are eating moldy millet.

15:22.600 --> 15:26.120
Who knows what bad food we will eat?

15:26.120 --> 15:29.000
This matter is not so simple.

15:29.000 --> 15:31.120
I'm afraid before justice is served,

15:31.120 --> 15:33.240
we'll put our lives at risk.

15:33.240 --> 15:35.240
How can you be so cowardly?

15:35.240 --> 15:36.799
Lady He

15:36.799 --> 15:38.399
is more courageous than you.

15:38.399 --> 15:41.360
This is a matter that concerns our own health.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.720
If everyone were like you,

15:42.720 --> 15:44.000
waiting for others to take the lead,

15:44.000 --> 15:45.159
this matter would come to nothing.

15:45.159 --> 15:46.840
That would be fatal.

15:46.840 --> 15:48.840
Bring our millet here.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.360
We must be united in this matter.

15:50.360 --> 15:51.960
Every one of us should join her.

15:52.840 --> 15:55.480
Lady He, I will go with you.

15:55.480 --> 15:58.159
We must make the officials
give us all an explanation.

15:58.159 --> 15:59.200
Excuse me, please make way.

15:59.200 --> 16:00.279
Thank you, madam.

16:00.279 --> 16:01.352
Lady He.

16:01.960 --> 16:05.000
The flower guild will join you.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.799
Thank you, Mr. Lv.

16:07.639 --> 16:11.080
Look, if you no longer want to live in fear,

16:11.639 --> 16:13.159
then join me.

16:13.159 --> 16:15.600
Go to the government office
to seek justice for ourselves.

16:16.679 --> 16:18.679
Demand justice!

16:19.399 --> 16:22.440
Demand justice!

16:25.399 --> 16:39.440
Demand justice!

16:39.440 --> 16:41.440
The moldy millet sold
in the West Market is right on the cart.

16:41.440 --> 16:43.279
We're going to the government office
to file a case.

16:43.279 --> 16:46.279
Demand justice!

16:46.879 --> 16:50.200
Demand justice!

16:50.200 --> 16:53.000
Everyone, let's get united as one.

16:53.000 --> 16:55.440
Gather all the moldy millet together.

16:56.039 --> 16:57.840
We're going to the government office
to file a case.

16:57.840 --> 17:00.360
Demand justice!

17:00.360 --> 17:01.919
Moldy millet.

17:01.919 --> 17:04.000
Who else has moldy millet?

17:04.000 --> 17:05.759
Demand justice!

17:15.400 --> 17:17.079
Mind your own business.

17:17.880 --> 17:19.599
What are you doing here?

17:19.599 --> 17:20.720
Who's leading this?

17:22.200 --> 17:24.079
I gathered everyone here.

17:24.680 --> 17:26.400
But I'm not making trouble.

17:26.400 --> 17:27.640
If we don't do this,

17:27.640 --> 17:30.279
will you do justice for the common people?

17:30.880 --> 17:32.799
After all, the people who wanted to file a case

17:32.799 --> 17:35.400
were turned away by the Jingzhao Prefecture.

17:35.400 --> 17:36.552
Really?

17:38.759 --> 17:41.359
You are growing more and more negligent.

17:41.359 --> 17:43.880
This matter concerns the people's livelihood.
How dare you not report it.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.359
I thought it was not a serious matter.

17:46.359 --> 17:47.720
Please forgive me.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.240
I'll get back to you later.

17:52.880 --> 17:56.640
Lady He, you and I are acquainted.

17:56.640 --> 18:00.559
I didn't know before
that you were Mr. Jiang's friend.

18:00.559 --> 18:02.559
It's a misunderstanding today.

18:02.559 --> 18:04.559
Since you are the complainant,

18:04.559 --> 18:08.599
come with me to the government office.

18:08.599 --> 18:10.440
This matter is unrelated to Mr. Jiang.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.119
You needn't bring him into this.

18:12.119 --> 18:15.240
Now, all the grain shops
in the West Market make a mistake.

18:15.240 --> 18:17.799
Countless people have fallen ill
from eating bad millet.

18:17.799 --> 18:21.039
Like everyone else, I am also a victim.

18:21.039 --> 18:22.519
This case is no trivial matter.

18:22.519 --> 18:24.240
It should be jointly judged
by the three ministries.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.960
There's no need for the Jingzhao Prefecture
to handle it.

18:25.960 --> 18:27.000
How dare you!

18:28.240 --> 18:30.000
It's just a small matter of moldy millet.

18:30.000 --> 18:32.000
Why make such a fuss over it?

18:32.000 --> 18:35.000
Officials have so many things
to deal with every day.

18:35.000 --> 18:37.279
If every single case is reported
to the three ministries,

18:37.279 --> 18:39.400
it will mess up the proceedings.

18:40.119 --> 18:41.680
Get out of here!

18:41.680 --> 18:42.920
If you continue,

18:43.480 --> 18:46.640
I'll punish you.

18:47.880 --> 18:48.920
It's so unfair.

18:48.920 --> 18:50.120
He's actually threatening us.

18:50.120 --> 18:51.160
Yeah.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.904
- It's not our fault.
- Get the millet.

18:52.904 --> 18:53.920
Get the millet.

18:53.920 --> 18:55.160
Yes.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.168
Stop!

18:57.000 --> 18:58.720
This millet is our evidence.

18:58.720 --> 19:00.960
If they take it away,

19:00.960 --> 19:04.279
I'm afraid the millet case will be obscured
without explanation.

19:05.039 --> 19:07.640
What a bold commoner.

19:07.640 --> 19:09.319
How dare you obstruct official business.

19:09.839 --> 19:11.400
Quick, get the millet.

19:11.400 --> 19:12.599
Go!

19:12.599 --> 19:13.799
Stop it.

19:13.799 --> 19:15.279
- Stop it.
- Don't move.

19:16.079 --> 19:17.279
Stop it.

19:17.279 --> 19:18.792
Give it back to us.

19:18.792 --> 19:19.799
Stop it.

19:19.799 --> 19:21.000
Don't hurt us.

19:21.000 --> 19:22.400
Let go.

19:22.400 --> 19:23.640
Put it down.

19:31.359 --> 19:33.519
Stop it!

19:33.519 --> 19:35.279
- Stop it.
- Back off.

19:35.279 --> 19:37.119
Attention.

19:39.599 --> 19:41.960
Please hear me out.

19:41.960 --> 19:44.279
What do we toil every day for?

19:44.799 --> 19:47.640
To provide a better life for our families.

19:47.640 --> 19:48.759
Yes, exactly.

19:48.759 --> 19:53.119
The taxes we pay increase every year.

19:53.119 --> 19:54.920
But what do we get in return?

19:54.920 --> 19:58.400
Moldy millet and weakened bodies.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.480
That's true.

19:59.480 --> 20:01.039
What we're holding in our hands

20:01.039 --> 20:03.599
is the millet we bought with our own money.

20:03.599 --> 20:07.039
We're on the streets
where the common people can pass.

20:07.039 --> 20:09.440
We didn't smash the shops
that sell moldy millet.

20:09.440 --> 20:12.119
Nor did we beat up the merchants
who sell moldy millet.

20:12.119 --> 20:14.640
We didn't break laws.

20:14.640 --> 20:18.519
All we do is to seek justice for ourselves.

20:18.519 --> 20:20.200
On what grounds do you arrest people?

20:20.200 --> 20:22.160
Why destroy our evidence?

20:22.160 --> 20:23.319
Lady He is right.

20:24.079 --> 20:25.559
Even officials cannot arrest people
without cause.

20:25.559 --> 20:27.119
You can't arrest people without reason.

20:27.720 --> 20:28.880
You can't arrest people without reason.

20:29.799 --> 20:31.119
Stop it. Be quiet.

20:32.799 --> 20:34.319
Food is a must for the people.

20:34.319 --> 20:36.440
And the people are the foundation of a nation.

20:36.440 --> 20:38.599
The millet case is huge.

20:38.599 --> 20:40.400
It should be judged by His Majesty.

20:40.400 --> 20:50.480
Let His Majesty judge.

20:50.480 --> 20:56.776
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

21:04.880 --> 21:08.799
The flowers in your mansion are blooming well.

21:08.799 --> 21:10.279
They're not inferior to those in the palace.

21:11.599 --> 21:13.599
Hundreds of flowers bloom for Your Majesty.

21:13.599 --> 21:15.039
If they can make Your Majesty happy,

21:15.039 --> 21:17.599
it's a great honor for those flowers and me.

21:20.960 --> 21:22.599
On my way here,

21:22.599 --> 21:24.880
I heard of something.

21:24.880 --> 21:28.559
The grain shops in the West Market
are selling moldy millet,

21:28.559 --> 21:30.799
causing public resentment.

21:30.799 --> 21:32.039
[Bloom into Fullness]
What happened?

21:34.680 --> 21:39.200
Your Majesty, that's utterly groundless.

21:39.200 --> 21:42.279
I have not heard of it.

21:42.279 --> 21:45.359
So, it's misinformation?

21:45.359 --> 21:48.712
Many officials had diarrhea
at Mr. Jiang's banquet.

21:48.712 --> 21:51.240
Didn't you hear about it?

21:51.240 --> 21:54.559
Diarrhea? What happened?

21:55.240 --> 21:58.440
Your Majesty, my subordinate
attended Mr. Jiang's banquet.

21:58.440 --> 22:00.720
After eating the millet soup, he had diarrhea.

22:00.720 --> 22:03.160
The next day, he asked for leave.

22:03.160 --> 22:06.200
I heard Mr. Jiang's servant bought bad millet
from the West Market.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.279
The health of many officials got hurt.

22:09.960 --> 22:13.400
The Jingzhao Prefecture
clarified it the next day.

22:13.400 --> 22:16.400
A grain shop accidentally sold old millet.

22:16.400 --> 22:19.000
Upon discovery, they immediately
withdrew the moldy millet.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.880
The related merchant has been punished.

22:21.440 --> 22:23.960
Exactly, I've instructed the market official

22:24.480 --> 22:25.880
to thoroughly investigate this case.

22:25.880 --> 22:27.640
This must not happen again.

22:28.319 --> 22:29.599
Your Majesty, as you know,

22:29.599 --> 22:32.559
I often go to the West Market
to watch the Huxuan dance.

22:32.559 --> 22:34.519
The shops there are well-organized.

22:34.519 --> 22:36.559
Furthermore, there are countless exotic items.

22:37.279 --> 22:39.640
The common people have much to enjoy there.

22:39.640 --> 22:40.680
It's very peaceful.

22:45.480 --> 22:46.504
Your Majesty.

22:49.680 --> 22:51.559
You need to know more of this case

22:51.559 --> 22:53.559
to find out the truth.

22:53.559 --> 22:56.799
The commoners in the West Market are shocked
and enraged by the moldy millet incident.

22:56.799 --> 22:59.319
Unafraid of official suppression,
they demand justice.

22:59.319 --> 23:02.200
So, you heard the voices of accusation.

23:02.200 --> 23:03.920
If this case is not investigated,

23:03.920 --> 23:05.799
the boiling public resentment may one day

23:05.799 --> 23:08.559
lead to a fierce fight.

23:11.559 --> 23:14.519
Your Majesty, the bad millet has damaged
not only the livelihood of the people

23:14.519 --> 23:16.519
but also the health of numerous officials.

23:16.519 --> 23:18.319
I implore Your Majesty to investigate.

23:20.279 --> 23:22.519
Water can carry a boat; it can also capsize it.

23:22.519 --> 23:24.200
I can't let the people down.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.480
Besides, if you officials lose their health,

23:27.480 --> 23:29.240
you won't work for me well.

23:30.240 --> 23:33.759
It's a livelihood case
that should be handled by the three ministries.

23:35.319 --> 23:37.240
The Censor acts as the chief judge.

23:37.240 --> 23:41.559
You must find out the truth
for me, the common people,

23:41.559 --> 23:42.680
and the officials.

23:43.279 --> 23:45.839
Your Majesty is wise. As you command.

23:50.000 --> 23:54.279
Your Majesty, the Censorate doesn't know
about the East Market and West Market well.

23:54.880 --> 23:57.559
Well, Liu Shen has been working hard.

23:57.559 --> 24:00.440
The market officials who oversee both markets
are his subordinates.

24:00.440 --> 24:02.960
Master Liu should investigate this case,

24:02.960 --> 24:05.000
with the Censor helping him.

24:05.000 --> 24:07.319
Only then can Your Majesty be less worried.

24:10.759 --> 24:13.440
Okay, I'll take your advice.

24:14.039 --> 24:17.240
Investigate this case
to calm the people's anger.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.200
Yes.

24:25.440 --> 24:27.839
Master Liu, this case is huge.

24:27.839 --> 24:30.480
Please come with me to inspect the West Market.

24:31.480 --> 24:33.720
Master Liu has important things to do.

24:33.720 --> 24:36.359
You visit the West Market tomorrow morning.

24:36.359 --> 24:38.039
Mr. Jiang, this case is urgent.

24:38.039 --> 24:40.000
Can you put your thing aside?

24:40.000 --> 24:41.519
What if it concerns His Majesty?

24:43.839 --> 24:45.640
His Majesty has grown tired
of watching flowers.

24:45.640 --> 24:47.480
Upon hearing of the prosperity
of the West Market,

24:47.480 --> 24:50.079
he's commanded me to find some dancers
to perform in the palace.

24:50.079 --> 24:51.880
He also asked me to find some exotic trinkets.

24:52.519 --> 24:54.200
Master Liu must go with me.

24:54.839 --> 24:58.359
If His Majesty can't see the Huxuan dance
tonight, he will be displeased.

24:58.359 --> 25:00.200
You and I can't afford it.

25:02.759 --> 25:03.880
Let's go, Master Liu.

25:12.160 --> 25:15.319
I heard that He Weifang was the one
who stirred up things in the West Market.

25:15.319 --> 25:17.640
She has tarnished my reputation.

25:17.640 --> 25:18.824
After faking death to escape,

25:18.824 --> 25:22.119
she gained favor from you
and became your servant.

25:22.119 --> 25:24.519
It's clear that she is quite scheming.

25:24.519 --> 25:27.240
Mr. Jiang, do not be used by her again.

25:28.480 --> 25:31.160
In front of me, she's only to be used.

25:32.240 --> 25:34.880
She is nothing but a lowly merchant.

25:34.880 --> 25:36.920
Yet she could stir up things

25:36.920 --> 25:39.119
and even get the news to His Majesty's ears.

25:39.119 --> 25:41.559
Mr. Jiang, you must be cautious.

25:42.559 --> 25:44.119
She loves money.

25:44.119 --> 25:46.640
If she loses money, she will fight.

25:47.400 --> 25:49.480
Moreover, she is a woman.

25:49.480 --> 25:51.720
She's been disfigured by moldy millet.
How could she not be angry?

25:52.759 --> 25:54.559
Making a scene on the street is no big deal.

25:54.559 --> 25:57.519
Anyway, she makes money for me.

25:57.519 --> 25:59.319
Nothing else matters.

26:00.000 --> 26:01.960
You're very tolerant.

26:01.960 --> 26:03.160
She stirred up things,

26:03.160 --> 26:06.400
which could make me lose my position.

26:07.839 --> 26:10.240
Haven't I bought you more time?

26:10.240 --> 26:11.960
That's enough for you to handle this case.

26:13.279 --> 26:15.359
I am grateful for your help.

26:15.359 --> 26:18.200
I hope you can properly control Lady He

26:18.200 --> 26:20.640
and let her behave
and not cause any more trouble.

26:21.440 --> 26:24.519
I help you for the sake of His Highness.

26:25.319 --> 26:27.359
How dare you make decisions for me.

26:28.000 --> 26:29.799
Because of your incompetence,

26:29.799 --> 26:31.880
the moldy millet matter
has become known to everyone.

26:32.680 --> 26:35.119
Even I suffered from the bad millet.

26:35.119 --> 26:36.759
I ran to the toilet seven times in one night.

26:36.759 --> 26:38.240
Now I'm feeling weak.

26:38.240 --> 26:40.039
How shall you compensate me?

26:41.079 --> 26:43.759
I'm sorry. Please don't be mad.

26:44.359 --> 26:46.160
Once I get through this matter,

26:46.160 --> 26:48.359
I will offer a generous gift to you.

26:50.480 --> 26:53.440
I'll endure it on behalf of His Highness.

26:54.079 --> 26:56.240
I hope you will quickly fix it.

26:56.240 --> 26:59.279
Do not disappoint His Highness again
because of your incompetence.

26:59.279 --> 27:00.296
Yes.

27:06.599 --> 27:07.680
Hurry up.

27:14.359 --> 27:16.079
Master, the market official
has readied the granary.

27:16.079 --> 27:17.640
Good millet will be delivered later.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.079
Alright, as soon as possible.

27:19.079 --> 27:20.136
Okay.

27:21.519 --> 27:22.600
There's more.

27:24.440 --> 27:25.640
Hurry up.

27:27.839 --> 27:29.920
Even if His Majesty learns
about the boiling public resentment

27:29.920 --> 27:31.799
and orders an investigation of the matter,

27:31.799 --> 27:34.519
Liu Shen just needs to replace the moldy millet
with the good one.

27:34.519 --> 27:35.759
Then he will get away with it.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.759
I need him to replace the moldy millet
with the good one.

27:39.480 --> 27:42.200
The call of action in the West Market
is just to draw him out.

27:42.880 --> 27:45.680
The real purpose is to make Liu Shen mess up.

27:45.680 --> 27:47.200
Before the investigation from above,

27:47.200 --> 27:48.839
he will transfer away the evidence of guilt.

27:49.680 --> 27:52.480
Sure, so you need

27:52.480 --> 27:55.480
to give Liu Shen this opportunity.

27:56.559 --> 27:58.599
No problem.

27:59.359 --> 28:01.640
Chuanyu will go with you

28:01.640 --> 28:04.279
to catch him red-handed and protect you.

28:07.799 --> 28:10.408
Make way!

28:11.279 --> 28:13.128
Move! Don't block the way!

28:13.128 --> 28:14.200
Should we start?

28:14.200 --> 28:15.720
Make way!

28:15.720 --> 28:18.359
Wait a moment until the passers-by walk away.

28:18.359 --> 28:19.440
Be careful not to hurt the innocent.

28:20.279 --> 28:21.559
Quick!

28:22.839 --> 28:24.440
Make way!

28:24.440 --> 28:25.480
Move!

28:35.400 --> 28:36.519
Master.

28:36.519 --> 28:38.720
Master, are you alright?

28:38.720 --> 28:39.759
Millet.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.200
Moldy millet, this is moldy millet.

28:44.200 --> 28:45.720
Look, moldy millet.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.839
It's really moldy millet.

28:47.944 --> 28:49.640
Be quick.

28:52.319 --> 28:53.440
Look, moldy millet.

28:56.599 --> 28:58.680
Stop it.

29:00.232 --> 29:01.240
Master.

29:01.240 --> 29:04.240
Stop it!

29:04.240 --> 29:05.519
Take Master away.

29:05.519 --> 29:06.680
Keep Master safe.

29:07.599 --> 29:09.160
Stop it!

29:09.160 --> 29:10.359
Take Master away.

29:12.039 --> 29:13.096
Stop it!

29:14.519 --> 29:16.599
Stop it!

29:36.559 --> 29:38.680
Help!

29:51.759 --> 29:53.559
Forget the tribute medicine.

29:54.160 --> 29:56.000
We must not let Lady He discover

29:56.000 --> 29:58.039
what we gave back then was fake.

30:08.880 --> 30:10.039
Help!

30:10.039 --> 30:11.440
Master.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.680
- Move.
- Move.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.736
Quick.

30:13.736 --> 30:16.880
Master, give me your hand.

30:23.079 --> 30:24.680
Master, are you alright?

30:24.680 --> 30:26.920
Make way!

30:26.920 --> 30:29.064
Stand back!

30:33.920 --> 30:35.112
Liu Shen.

30:37.079 --> 30:38.319
Do you admit your guilt?

30:40.840 --> 30:41.880
Take him away!

30:41.880 --> 30:42.984
Yes.

30:45.920 --> 30:48.119
Mother, Yulu,

30:49.119 --> 30:50.279
have you seen it?

30:51.559 --> 30:53.279
Take them away together!

30:53.279 --> 30:54.312
Yes.

30:57.339 --> 31:00.072
[Liu Mansion]

31:16.720 --> 31:18.680
Liu Shen is a spineless worm.

31:18.680 --> 31:20.799
Once imprisoned, he utterly collapsed.

31:20.799 --> 31:22.920
The Chen family bore the brunt.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.559
Since Prince Ning stood by,

31:25.200 --> 31:27.799
to save his own life,
he had no choice but to report others

31:27.799 --> 31:31.200
The officials of the Ministry of Personnel
and the Vice Minister of Revenue,

31:31.200 --> 31:33.440
are guilty of corruption, bribery,
land grabbing, and deals of official positions.

31:33.440 --> 31:34.640
Their crimes have been made public.

31:36.359 --> 31:37.759
Prince Ning kept himself safe.

31:38.400 --> 31:41.799
The influential families close to him

31:41.799 --> 31:43.000
will complain about it.

31:44.920 --> 31:47.839
Now, there are many vacant positions.

31:48.359 --> 31:49.960
I guess Prince Ning can't help

31:49.960 --> 31:51.799
meddling in official appointments.

31:52.559 --> 31:55.640
Many of his people have been implicated
in this case.

31:56.279 --> 31:58.079
He just recommended some men.

31:58.079 --> 32:00.920
Yet, his recommendation was rejected
by the upright senior officials.

32:01.839 --> 32:04.880
Prince Ning didn't want to provoke trouble
and had to give up.

32:04.880 --> 32:07.279
Our people have taken the key positions.

32:07.279 --> 32:09.079
After things are over,

32:09.079 --> 32:11.079
even if Prince Ning tries
to appoint his own people again,

32:11.079 --> 32:13.279
it's all within our control.

32:16.079 --> 32:18.680
A grain of millet is tiny,

32:19.680 --> 32:20.759
but it affects the will of the people.

32:22.240 --> 32:24.240
Prince Ning's financial source
has been cut off.

32:24.240 --> 32:26.400
And bad officials have been eradicated.

32:27.079 --> 32:28.599
The Military Governor is sly,

32:28.599 --> 32:30.400
swaying with the wind.

32:30.400 --> 32:31.960
It's even harder for Prince Ning

32:31.960 --> 32:35.039
to get his support if he can't give him money.

32:36.519 --> 32:38.359
Now, the governor of Eastern Capital is…

32:39.359 --> 32:42.119
Your favorite student, Cheng Lang.

32:42.119 --> 32:44.400
He will return the land to the people.

32:44.400 --> 32:45.640
Don't worry.

32:49.319 --> 32:51.680
It's been years since we met in Chang'an.

32:52.559 --> 32:56.720
I hope to have tea with him again.

33:00.680 --> 33:02.799
No matter how entrenched
Prince Ning's power is,

33:03.319 --> 33:05.480
it will be uprooted entirely one day.

33:07.400 --> 33:08.519
Don't be sad, sir.

33:10.319 --> 33:12.279
I feel sorry for Cheng Lang.

33:17.759 --> 33:19.880
You care about Cheng Lang.

33:19.880 --> 33:21.440
Cheng Lang cares about Your Majesty.

33:22.599 --> 33:25.000
But no one cares about me.

33:25.640 --> 33:27.480
Mr. Third cares about you.

33:27.480 --> 33:28.880
And Mudan.

33:28.880 --> 33:31.039
She's just a florist.

33:31.559 --> 33:34.279
Yet, she aided you in such a dangerous affair.

33:35.480 --> 33:37.279
She did it all not for me

33:37.799 --> 33:38.880
but for herself

33:39.480 --> 33:42.160
and the merchants and commoners.

33:43.451 --> 33:45.032
Mudan knows

33:45.032 --> 33:48.319
there is strength in numbers.

33:50.559 --> 33:53.839
What a pity. If she were a man,

33:53.839 --> 33:56.480
she would certainly achieve great things.

33:57.680 --> 33:58.960
So what if she is a woman?

33:59.839 --> 34:02.759
She has done what she wanted to do.

34:07.803 --> 34:08.519
[Liu Mansion]

34:08.519 --> 34:10.679
Liu Shen is in big trouble this time.

34:10.679 --> 34:11.688
Sure.

34:15.119 --> 34:17.039
The County Princess likes you very much.

34:17.639 --> 34:20.519
As long as you get engaged with her again,

34:20.519 --> 34:23.320
she promises to save your father.

34:26.199 --> 34:29.239
Son, don't hesitate anymore.

34:29.760 --> 34:31.280
Your father is in prison now.

34:31.280 --> 34:33.480
We don't know if he's alright.

34:34.719 --> 34:36.440
You've been asking for help,

34:36.440 --> 34:38.320
but is there anyone willing to help you?

34:39.559 --> 34:43.639
Now, only the County Princess
can save our family.

34:49.599 --> 34:51.239
Will you actually watch your father

34:51.239 --> 34:53.880
be exiled and die alone far from home?

34:54.719 --> 34:58.599
Zishu, I'm begging you.

34:58.599 --> 35:00.639
Please save your father.

35:03.039 --> 35:04.480
Zishu.

35:12.280 --> 35:14.000
Zishu.

35:34.800 --> 35:37.480
Youzhen, let's get married.

35:42.679 --> 35:43.752
Okay.

35:46.480 --> 35:49.840
He canceled the engagement.

35:49.840 --> 35:51.400
It's too late to regret it.

35:51.400 --> 35:53.280
My reputation has been ruined.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.880
I can't marry into a noble family.

35:55.519 --> 35:56.880
Father, please allow me to marry him.

35:56.880 --> 35:58.639
Who dares to find fault with my daughter?

35:59.480 --> 36:01.119
Any man you like--

36:01.119 --> 36:03.280
I'd rather die if I can't marry Liu Chang.

36:04.920 --> 36:06.024
Back off!

36:08.039 --> 36:09.920
The Chen family has already lost power.

36:10.440 --> 36:12.800
You did not rescue them.

36:12.800 --> 36:15.159
Others will feel disappointed.

36:15.159 --> 36:17.840
The Chen family has committed too many crimes.

36:18.440 --> 36:19.760
If I step in to save them,

36:19.760 --> 36:21.079
in any case,

36:21.079 --> 36:23.079
I will get myself into trouble.

36:23.079 --> 36:24.760
You should not interfere.

36:24.760 --> 36:27.159
I'll explain to the noble families.

36:29.400 --> 36:32.840
Actions are more persuasive than any words.

36:32.840 --> 36:34.679
The only crime of Liu Shen is embezzlement.

36:34.679 --> 36:35.840
It is not difficult to save him.

36:36.960 --> 36:40.679
Other families will understand if you do so.

36:40.679 --> 36:43.880
As long as they're loyal and useful,
they won't be abandoned.

36:45.280 --> 36:47.039
In this way, you'll reassure them

36:48.320 --> 36:49.719
and get their support.

36:55.039 --> 36:59.280
Did Liu Chang teach you to say that?

36:59.880 --> 37:00.904
Yes.

37:04.840 --> 37:07.639
It seems he's not as useless as I thought.

37:12.760 --> 37:16.280
Alright, put down the knife.

37:19.400 --> 37:20.880
Put it down.

37:22.039 --> 37:23.360
You can marry him.

37:25.280 --> 37:26.320
Thank you, father.

37:33.440 --> 37:34.472
Get up.

37:37.480 --> 37:39.960
Youzhen, remember,

37:40.719 --> 37:43.079
anyone can become your pawn

37:44.039 --> 37:45.760
even if they are not loyal to you.

37:47.800 --> 37:51.528
The Chen family is too greedy.

37:51.528 --> 37:54.719
They even deceived me for personal gain.

37:56.320 --> 37:59.880
But I still need to use them.

38:00.519 --> 38:03.760
So I didn't deal with them.

38:04.840 --> 38:06.800
You've long wanted to discard them.

38:10.599 --> 38:13.519
You need to learn how to tolerate
and use people.

38:14.880 --> 38:16.800
As long as the benefits are big enough,

38:16.800 --> 38:20.119
there will always be people
who can be of use to you.

38:22.159 --> 38:23.960
Go back and tell Liu Zishu.

38:24.559 --> 38:28.440
To be my son-in-law,
loyalty is the most important thing.

38:29.840 --> 38:33.159
I can tolerate him
for canceling the engagement once.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.679
But I will never tolerate it again.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.039
Great!

38:38.760 --> 38:39.944
Great!

38:51.679 --> 38:52.840
You have no conscience.

38:52.840 --> 38:54.239
- He deserves it.
- Look.

38:54.800 --> 38:56.159
Look at him.

38:56.159 --> 38:57.360
Great.

38:58.280 --> 38:59.400
Hit hard.

39:01.352 --> 39:07.816
♫ They say I'm overestimating myself ♫

39:09.320 --> 39:12.079
Now the West Market is orderly.
The goods are nice and cheap.

39:12.079 --> 39:13.320
You have got your revenge.

39:14.119 --> 39:16.440
Mudan, aren't you happy?

39:18.639 --> 39:20.000
The common people pay taxes
according to the law.

39:20.559 --> 39:23.440
The government should
return a fair West Market to us.

39:23.440 --> 39:24.679
That's their job.

39:26.119 --> 39:27.519
Without Jiang Changyang's message,

39:28.079 --> 39:30.199
I'm afraid
we would be as happy as everyone else

39:30.199 --> 39:32.480
about the punishment for Liu Shen.

39:33.000 --> 39:36.920
In fact, Liu Chang has re-engaged
with Prince Ning's daughter.

39:36.920 --> 39:38.639
Just one word from Prince Ning

39:38.639 --> 39:40.400
can spare Liu Shen.

39:41.280 --> 39:42.480
And Liu Shen was hit in public

39:43.000 --> 39:44.880
just to silence the gossip.

39:46.239 --> 39:48.239
As long as Liu Chang
is Prince Ning's son-in-law,

39:49.119 --> 39:51.480
no matter what crime his father commits,

39:51.480 --> 39:53.559
his father will be treated with leniency.

39:54.360 --> 39:57.800
What the authorities truly restrict and punish

39:58.400 --> 40:00.239
are just merchants and commoners.

40:04.000 --> 40:06.320
Liu Shen cares most about his reputation
and official career.

40:06.320 --> 40:08.079
He will never be an official again.

40:08.079 --> 40:10.519
It will make him suffer more.

40:10.519 --> 40:12.599
Your mother and Yulu will be happy

40:12.599 --> 40:13.719
about Liu Shen being beaten.

40:15.920 --> 40:18.320
And Liu Chang canceled his engagement before.

40:18.320 --> 40:20.239
But now, to save his father,
he has to marry the County Princess.

40:20.239 --> 40:21.760
The County Princess has a bad temper.

40:21.760 --> 40:24.039
She will fight with Liu Chang's mother.

40:24.039 --> 40:25.639
If so, she…

40:27.679 --> 40:31.119
Fu, thank you.

40:35.960 --> 40:37.000
You're right.

40:37.880 --> 40:40.519
We should look on the bright side of things.

40:41.280 --> 40:42.800
Liu Chang is inherently conceited.

40:42.800 --> 40:44.360
If he marries the County Princess,

40:44.360 --> 40:46.079
his family will be restless.

40:47.039 --> 40:49.079
And Liu Shen's career is completely destroyed.

40:49.639 --> 40:52.159
It's inevitable that Liu Chang
and his father will become estranged.

40:52.159 --> 40:54.840
I believe

40:54.840 --> 40:57.039
the evil will pay for what they do.

40:59.320 --> 41:01.719
Alright, let me treat you to a meal.

41:02.376 --> 41:03.400
Alright.

41:03.400 --> 41:04.400
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

41:05.384 --> 41:11.880
♫ Looking back,
I've traveled a thousand miles ♫

41:11.880 --> 41:14.239
I knew you would definitely want to come here.

41:16.480 --> 41:19.079
Be careful not to break it.

41:22.480 --> 41:23.800
You two, mind your step.

41:23.800 --> 41:25.800
Previously, you asked the house broker
to keep you updated

41:25.800 --> 41:28.599
about the sale of Fragrance Garden.

41:28.599 --> 41:29.704
Look.

41:32.239 --> 41:33.360
Fragrance Garden is for sale?

41:34.280 --> 41:35.639
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

41:35.639 --> 41:37.280
I heard of it yesterday.

41:37.280 --> 41:38.480
I wanted to surprise you.

41:38.480 --> 41:40.039
Another good news now.

41:41.039 --> 41:42.440
Are you happy?

41:42.440 --> 41:43.719
Sure, I am.

41:43.719 --> 41:46.360
It's the best surprise for me.

41:46.360 --> 41:47.800
Let's go and ask

41:47.800 --> 41:48.960
how much that house is for sale.

41:48.960 --> 41:49.960
Let's go.

42:07.579 --> 42:13.853
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:15.707 --> 42:22.391
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:23.067 --> 42:30.265
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:31.259 --> 42:39.611
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:39.611 --> 42:47.154
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:47.808 --> 42:55.995
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:55.995 --> 43:03.806
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:04.411 --> 43:11.703
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:32.379 --> 43:39.262
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:40.563 --> 43:47.257
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:48.014 --> 43:55.316
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:56.000 --> 44:04.309
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

44:04.309 --> 44:11.740
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:12.571 --> 44:20.827
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:20.827 --> 44:28.251
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:29.255 --> 44:36.705
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
